   134→\subsection{Ablation Studies}
   135→
   136→To systematically validate each architectural component's contribution, we conduct comprehensive ablation experiments. Table~\ref{tab:ablation} presents ablation results analyzing: (1) incremental component addition starting from baseline concatenation fusion; (2) component removal from the full model to assess individual importance; (3) fusion strategy variants comparing cross-attention against alternatives; (4) architecture variants (CNN-only, Transformer-only, Hybrid).
